  "body": "Premium, freehold and designed for effortless modern living, this brand-new home combines quality craftsmanship with a stylish, low-maintenance lifestyle. Thoughtfully crafted for modern family living, it offers the perfect balance of comfort, functionality and contemporary design.\r\n\r\nBeautifully finished throughout with generous proportions and an easy-care layout, this is a home you'll be proud to call your own. An exceptional opportunity in a sought-after Torbay location - one you'll want to inspect.\r\n\r\nAll conjunctional agents welcome!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* Title & CCC Issued.\r\n* High-spec kitchen featuring premium Miele appliances and quality finishes.\r\n* 3 bedrooms with master ensuite and another semi-ensuite.\r\n* 1 separate study, ideal for working from home or a guest room.\r\n* 3 well-appointed bathrooms with underfloor heating and 1 guest powder room.\r\n* Open-plan living and dining area with excellent natural light.\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow to a private entertaining deck.\r\n* 1 internal access garage plus 1 covered parking space.\r\n* Zoned for Glamorgan School, Northcross Intermediate and Long Bay College.",
